This independent C# client follows the ChameleonUltra USB protocol and
adapts the command framing, reader-mode workflow and Viking/T55xx payload
behavior documented in the upstream client and firmware implementation.
Viking decoding and physical tag programming are provided by the device
firmware, not implemented anew by this client.

